    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a lonely stretch of road outside of Houma, Louisiana, is a gentlemen's club: <i>Heaven's Door</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263380/extras/f9a36a0929723179a6b519f248ac1da8.avif?t=1750638157\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One late Thursday night you are driving by, as you have a dozen times over a dozen recent Thursdays. This time, however, something tells you to park and head inside...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the course of your life changes in ways you could not have imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <i>Bare Witness</i>, join us as we tell the story of a man with little left to lose, and nothing left to live for, who finds a bit of each in the most unlikely place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nearly a dozen main love interests, branching storylines, and plenty of sexiness, we hope you'll find many reasons to return again and again to Heaven's Door. So find a seat, get your singles ready, and prepare for the ride of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263380/extras/fc2b2afd5f19514439a9b42a6f99392f.avif?t=1750638157\" data-has-big width=800 height=343 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a lonely stretch of road outside of Houma, Louisiana, is a gentlemen's club: <i>Heaven's Door</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263380/extras/f9a36a0929723179a6b519f248ac1da8.avif?t=1750638157\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One late Thursday night you are driving by, as you have a dozen times over a dozen recent Thursdays. This time, however, something tells you to park and head inside...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the course of your life changes in ways you could not have imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <i>Bare Witness</i>, join us as we tell the story of a man with little left to lose, and nothing left to live for, who finds a bit of each in the most unlikely place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nearly a dozen main love interests, branching storylines, and plenty of sexiness, we hope you'll find many reasons to return again and again to Heaven's Door. So find a seat, get your singles ready, and prepare for the ride of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263380/extras/fc2b2afd5f19514439a9b42a6f99392f.avif?t=1750638157\" data-has-big width=800 height=343 /></span></p>",
